{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute critters vs. evil cockroaches \u2014 a chaotic, dark-humored top-down roguelike with tower defense elements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive for 8-15 days \u2014 build clever strategies by day, and dive into a frantic bullet-hell battlefield at night!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build by day, fight by night</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630680/extras/b5fa312a09fa4979b7277bc3c95bccd4.poster.avif?t=1768834454\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630680/extras/b5fa312a09fa4979b7277bc3c95bccd4.webm?t=1768834454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630680/extras/b5fa312a09fa4979b7277bc3c95bccd4.mp4?t=1768834454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up your defenses during the day, then jump into the action at night to battle the roach hordes. Depending on difficulty, you\u2019ll defend your home for 8\u201315 days and take on different swarm bosses.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Theorycraft builds and create team synergy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630680/extras/f4cd17ae20ff5296ce81a748790a12da.poster.avif?t=1768834454\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630680/extras/f4cd17ae20ff5296ce81a748790a12da.webm?t=1768834454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630680/extras/f4cd17ae20ff5296ce81a748790a12da.mp4?t=1768834454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo includes <strong>3 playable characters</strong>, <strong>35+ buildings/weapons</strong>, and <strong>90+ passive items</strong> to mix and match. Fire + explosions, electricity + towers, a kitten\u2019s glass-cannon build, a wolf leading the pack\u2026 there\u2019s always another unexpected combo waiting to be discovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630680/extras/38b32345aa5b1f982bd21c7908fa2170.poster.avif?t=1768834454\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630680/extras/38b32345aa5b1f982bd21c7908fa2170.webm?t=1768834454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630680/extras/38b32345aa5b1f982bd21c7908fa2170.mp4?t=1768834454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Retro sci-fi + cute critters, with minimalist stories (in progress)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630680/extras/6769dc25ee9ac128152ef350ab9e6a63.poster.avif?t=1768834454\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630680/extras/6769dc25ee9ac128152ef350ab9e6a63.webm?t=1768834454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630680/extras/6769dc25ee9ac128152ef350ab9e6a63.mp4?t=1768834454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is about a chaotic but fun universe where insect swarms, silicon-based lifeforms, and small animals coexist. Each successful mission unlocks fun comic-style story scenes\u2014revealing more secrets of this world!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Free Demo is coming \u2014 we\u2019d love your feedback!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is made by <i>two rats</i>! While the free demo is out, the full version is still in development. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re part-time indie devs, but we\u2019ll keep polishing the visuals, feel, and balance\u2014while adding more content. Your feedback means a lot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630680/extras/3541d31e983a621bda0ca14a3c18eff8.avif?t=1768834454\" width=559 height=317 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3630680?t=1768834454","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630680/c241ef63585899bede3a22d0087662a4f0ab86c1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768834454","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630680/7d775be4e278cd2a3bf88ff74a08348c7a5b7de0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768834454","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630680/7d775be4e278cd2a3bf88ff74a08348c7a5b7de0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768834454","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4299880,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute critters vs. evil cockroaches \u2014 a chaotic, dark-humored top-down roguelike with tower defense elements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive for 8-15 days \u2014 build clever strategies by day, and dive into a frantic bullet-hell battlefield at night!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build by day, fight by night</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630680/e